        "prompt": "Run the AP intake process now. Pick up everything that has arrived on the SFTP drop, the scanned folder and the AP mailbox. For each invoice, decide first whether it is READY to match: if there is no goods receipt yet and the delivery date has not passed the grace window in the AP policy manual, PARK it and say so \u2014 that is a timing difference, not an exception. For everything that is ready, run the three-way match against the PO and the goods receipt, classify any exception with a named cause and the amount at risk, and re-check anything previously parked to see if its receipt has now arrived. Report: processed, parked, newly cleared, and exceptions. Do not pay anything."
      },
